From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Date: Wed, 1 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] canaan-hardlock: add the k230 hardware spinlock driver

Add a driver for the K230 hardware spinlock block, compatible
canaan,k230-hardlock, and the <linux/canaan-hardlock.h> API:
request_lock() reserves a lock number, hardlock_lock() tries to take it
and hardlock_unlock() releases it. Each of the HARDLOCK_MAX locks is one
register; reading zero takes the lock and writing zero releases it.

Until the device has probed, the calls succeed without touching the
hardware, so drivers that take a lock also work on boards that do not
describe the block.

Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 drivers/canaan-hardlock/Kconfig           |  10 ++
 drivers/canaan-hardlock/Makefile          |   7 ++
 drivers/canaan-hardlock/canaan-hardlock.c | 122 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 include/linux/canaan-hardlock.h           |  11 ++
 4 files changed, 150 insertions(+)
